---
// Booking steps and why-us section
---
<section class="sec sec-white" id="booking" aria-labelledby="book-h">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div>
      <h2 id="book-h">How booking works</h2>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <div>
            <b>Tell us your dates and who is coming</b>
            <span>Use the form below or message us on WhatsApp. No account, no long forms.</span>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <b>Get a plan within a day</b>
            <span>A day-by-day itinerary and one price that includes permits and transfers.</span>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <b>Confirm with a small advance</b>
            <span>Pay by UPI or bank transfer. The balance is due a week before you leave.</span>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2>Why travel with us</h2>
      <dl class="facts">
        <div>
          <dt>Hosts you can name</dt>
          <dd>Every homestay and driver is someone our team has met. You get their names and numbers before you travel.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>One price</dt>
          <dd>Permits, transfers, taxes and sightseeing are in the quote. Extras are listed up front, never added later.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Built around your pace</dt>
          <dd>Travelling with parents or kids? We shorten drives and add rest days instead of cramming in stops.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Help on the road</dt>
          <dd>A real person on WhatsApp for the whole trip, including the day a road closes.</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .steps {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
    counter-reset: s;
  }

  .steps li {
    counter-increment: s;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3.2rem 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.4rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--mist);
  }

  .steps li:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mist);
  }

  .steps li::before {
    content: counter(s);
    font-stretch: 70%;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 3rem;
    line-height: 0.9;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .steps b {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }

  .steps span {
    color: var(--slate);
  }

  .facts {
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .facts div {
    padding: 1.4rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--mist);
  }

  .facts div:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mist);
  }

  .facts dt {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }

  .facts dd {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
    color: var(--slate);
  }
</style>
